Windows color input is fucked.

When you click on it, it always appears in the top left of the window, so you get
the annoying experience of clicking on the bottom, then the color picker appears
and you have to move your mouse across the screen.

Separately from windows, a list of recently used colors would be useful for when you
want to swap back and forth between different colors.

You would always want black and white to be on this list.
